IBCONTROLS Change Log  version          (1.0-2 Build 9) Sun, 2 Feb 2025 13:45:31 +0000

1. Ensure that cache bitmap is always nil after free (obscure protection fault with alt colours).

2. Resize refresh strategy after insert to avoid issues with TDataset.Modified. With IBX
   Modified is always true after insert and with old strategy inserted record was posted
   immediately. Other database drivers may not set Modified flag until other changes are
   made and this resulted in insert being cancelled immediately. Revised strategy
   leaves dataset in insert mode after refresh.

IBCONTROLS Change Log  version          (1.0-1 Build 9) Sun, 2 Feb 2025 13:45:31 +0000

1. Value  tvsUpdating was removed from TTreeViewState enumeration (unit ComCtrls), Lazarus 
   rev. 64855 (2021-03-22 by wp) in Lazarus/main. ibcontrols is now compatible with Lazarus/main
   and earlier versions. Use of tvsUpdating is now conditional of it being declared in ComCtrls. 

IBCONTROLS Change Log  version          (1.0-0 Build 0008) Tue, 31 Dec 2024 16:37:03 +0000

1. First release as a separate package from IBX


